@base = http://localhost:4000

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test1.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### Verify (put the code from Mailpit here)
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test1.com", "code": "368194" }

### Resend code
POST {{base}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test.com" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test.com", "password": "Test1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Validation error example
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "password": "abc" }

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save profile
PUT {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alan Test", "mobile": "+91 98765 43210", "address": "12 MG Road, Mangaluru, Karnataka 575001", "businessName": "" }

### Task catalogue
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save selected tasks
PUT {{base}}/me/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taskIds": [1, 5, 9] }

### My selected tasks
GET {{base}}/me/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token (should be 401)
GET {{base}}/me
